, the toggle is your own control (e.g. a `ToggleButton`) — give icon-only buttons an `aria-label`, and the content stays in the DOM and accessible since nothing is hidden."},"687":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-32","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"Accordion → `Button slot=\"trigger\"` + `InlineDrawerPanel`. Sidebar rail → controlled state + always-visible children."},"688":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-33","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"For the rail, use numeric (px) `minSize`/`maxSize` so the width animates; `min-content`/`max-content` fit the content exactly but won't animate."},"689":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-34","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"`placement` does not flip in RTL; the side is decided by document/flex order."},"690":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-35","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#best-practices","content":"Don't nest InlineDrawers."},"691":{"id":"/docs/components/input","page_id":"/docs/components/input","type":"page","content":"Input","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/input"},"692":{"id":"/docs/components/input-0","page_id":"/docs/components/input","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/input","content":"Single-line text control for use inside a field."},"693":{"id":"/docs/components/input-1","page_id":"/docs/components/input","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/input#installation","content":"Installation"},"694":{"id":"/docs/components/input-2","page_id":"/docs/components/input","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/input#examples","content":"Examples"},"695":{"id":"/docs/com