eading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#barchart","content":"BarChart"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"},"1712":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-37","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-38","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#default","content":"You give the chart a `series` array plus `xAccessor` and `yAccessor` so it knows which field is the category and which is the value - this is the everyday setup for one set of vertical bars."},"1723":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-39","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#multi-series","content":"Pass more than one entry in `series` and the bars group by category, with a legend naming each series. Use it when the comparison between series matters as much as the values themselves."},"1724":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-40","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-single-series","content":"`orientation=\"horizontal\"` swaps the axes: categories run down the side and values across the bottom. Reach for it when the labels are long or the chart is really a ranking."},"1725":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-41","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-multi-series","content":"Grouped bars work horizontally too. With many categories the chart scrolls vertically, which is usually easier on a phone than scrolling sideways."},"1726":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-42","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#custom-domain","content":"`xDomain` and `yDomain` pin down exactly which categories and value range to draw. Here category `F` has no data and still gets an empty slot, and the Y range stays `[0, 40]` even though the largest bar is 30 - handy when several charts need to share a scale."},"1727":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-43","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#formatted-tick-marks","content":"`xTickFormat` and `yTickFormat` shape the axis labels - abbreviated dates on one axis, thousands separators on the other. The functions receive the raw accessor value, so they also cover currency, units, or percentages."},"1728":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-44","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rtl-multi-series","content":"The chart follows the current layout direction, which is normally detected from the browser or system settings. In right-to-left it mirrors the axes, bars, and labels; this example forces RTL so you can see it in a left-to-right page. RTL support is still being refined - axis rendering and tick spacing in particular."},"1729":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-45","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rtl-horizontal-multi-series","content":"Horizontal grouped bars in a right-to-left layout: bars grow from the right edge and the category axis moves to the right side."},"1730":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-46","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-50","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-51","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-52","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-53","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-54","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-55","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-56","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-57","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-58","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"The component uses VisX primitives for optimal SVG rendering:"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-59","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-60","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-61","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-62","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-63","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-64","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-65","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"For charts with **many data points** (>20), consider enabling horizontal scroll (default behavior)"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-66","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"For **horizontal bar charts**, vertical scrolling is more mobile-friendly than horizontal"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-67","page_id":"/docs/component