t"],[1064,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1118,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1537,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1536,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[769,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1458,"`size` picks a step on the component's own ramp (`xs` to `2xl`) and changes only the font size."],[1581,"`size` sets every part, each on its own role ramp. Without it, the lockup follows the size\nscope."],[875,"`size` sets the label, input, and steppers. Without it, the field follows the surrounding size\nscope."],[1631,"`size` sets the label, input, description, and any control composed inside. Without it, the\nfield follows the surrounding size scope."],[395,"`size` sets the label, trigger, and calendar. Without it, the picker follows the surrounding\nsize scope."],[833,"`size` sets the modal's text, controls, and spacing. Without it, the modal follows the size\nscope around its trigger."],[509,"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets the accessible name, and takes the overlay's\ntitle tier, one step above the heading tier."],[1904,"`sm` - Small spacing"],[1172,"`sm`, `md`, or `lg` for everything inside: text, controls, and default spacing."],[46,"`Space` / `Enter`"],[1344,"`Space` toggles the switch when it has focus"],[1002,"`status` is independent of timeline and only controls the status icon and (for `error`) the accent bar color."],[44,"`Tab`"],[425,"`Tab`"],[454,"`Tab`"],[683,"`Tab`"],[837,"`Tab`"],[1659,"`Tab`"],[1391,"`Tab`: `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."],[1388,"`TabList` must be rendered inside `Tabs` and must provide `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. Give each `Tab` and its